294898\" width=365 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find yourself in any danger, the <strong>GunShop</strong> is not responsible for any damage physical or psychological on workers, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.poster.avif?t=1757294898\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.webm?t=1757294898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.mp4?t=1757294898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/c7e69698e46cd976d14a9dd3133bb297.avif?t=1757294898\" width=365 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always finish your work on time, every shift has a deadline to deliver your work, the workers that choose not to deliver in time, <span class=\"bb_strike\">are all sent to him</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.poster.avif?t=1757294898\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.webm?t=1757294898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.mp4?t=17